  </td>
  <td width="44%" valign="top" style="padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;width:44.84%;">
  <p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">BHM Management
  an oversight fee equal to 1% of gross revenues of the property managed. In no
