  operation, management, maintenance or access control of our properties,
  including taxes, insurance and benefits relating to such employees, and
  legal, travel and other out-of-pocket expenses that are directly related to
  the management of specific properties.</font></p>
  </td>
  <td width="2%" valign="bottom" style="padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;width:2.22%;">
