  <td width="25%" valign="top" style="padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;width:25.48%;">
  <p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">Asset Management Fee </font><font size="2" style="font-size:10.0pt;">&#151; Behringer Harvard Multifamily
  Advisors I or its affiliates</font></p>
  </td>
  <td width="2%" valign="bottom" style="padding:0in 0in 0in 0in;width:2.22%;">
