  <p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">Actual
  amounts are dependent upon </font><font size="2" style="font-size:10.0pt;">the sales price of specific properties</font><font size="2" style="font-size:10.0pt;"> and therefore
  cannot be determined at the present time.</font></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
