addition to amounts paid to Behringer Securities for selling commissions and
the dealer manager fee, we will reimburse our advisor for organization and
offering expenses that it incurs on our behalf&#160;
in connection with our primary offering (other than selling commissions
and the dealer manager fee), provided that at no point will we reimburse
