Executive Vice President of our advisor and Executive Vice President and
Co-Chief Operating Officer of Harvard Property Trust, LLC, an affiliate of our
sponsor and advisor.&#160; Prior to joining
Behringer Harvard in September&nbsp;2007, Mr.&nbsp;Chapman was Executive Vice
President and Chief Financial Officer of AMLI Residential Properties Trust,
formerly a New York Stock Exchange listed REIT, from December&nbsp;1997 to August&nbsp;2007.&#160; Mr.&nbsp;Chapman also served as an
independent board member and the audit committee chairman of Behringer Harvard
Opportunity REIT I from March&nbsp;2005 to August&nbsp;2007.&#160; From 1994 to</font></p>



