company&#146;s southwest region which was valued in excess of $1.1 billion.&#160; From 1997 to 2000, Mr.&nbsp;Odland was a
consultant with Pricewaterhouse Coopers in the Real Estate Advisory Group. In
this role, Mr.&nbsp;Odland performed valuation, market research, and due
diligence activities for publicly traded REITS and institutional real estate
funds.</font></p>

