material functions that our advisor will perform for us as our advisor, and it
is not intended to include all of the services that may be provided to us by
third parties.&#160; Under the terms of the
advisory management agreement, our advisor undertakes to use its best efforts
to present us with investment opportunities that are consistent with our
investment policies and objectives as adopted by our board of directors.&#160; Our advisor has a fiduciary duty and
responsibility to us and our stockholders.&#160;
In its performance of this undertaking, our advisor, either directly or
indirectly by engaging an affiliate, shall, subject to the authority of the
board:</font></p>

