<p align="left" style="font-size:10.0pt;margin:0in 0in .0001pt .25in;text-align:left;text-indent:-.25in;"><font size="2" face="Symbol" style="font-size:10.0pt;">&#183;</font><font size="1" style="font-size:3.0pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; </font>third-party acquisition expenses
related to the selection and acquisition of assets, whether or not acquired by
