services that are essential to us, including the sale of shares of our common
stock, asset acquisition and disposition decisions, property management and
leasing services and other general administrative responsibilities.&#160; In the event that these companies were unable
to provide us with the respective services, we would be required to obtain such
services from other sources.</font></p>



