<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;text-indent:.55in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">We
believe that we have property and liability insurance with reputable,
commercially rated companies.&#160; We also
believe that our insurance policies contain commercially reasonable deductibles
and limits, adequate to </font></p>

