<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;text-indent:.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">Our
investments, as well as any future investments that we may make, are subject to
various federal, state, local and foreign laws, ordinances and regulations,
including, among other things, zoning regulations, land use controls,
environmental controls relating to air and water quality, noise pollution and
indirect environmental impacts such as increased motor vehicle activity.&nbsp;
We believe that we have all permits and approvals necessary under current law
to operate our investments.</font></p>

