<!-- SEQ.=1,FOLIO='179',FILE='C:\JMS\eudelhofen\07-31961-1\task2929844\31961-1-bd-39.htm',USER='eudelho',CD='May  9 15:58 2008' -->


<br clear="all" style="page-break-before:always;">


<div style="font-family:Times New Roman;">



<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;text-indent:.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">As of December&nbsp;31, 2007, the Ventures held
contracts for equity investments and/or mortgage loans with a total commitment
value of approximately $126.5 million and the Ventures have currently funded
approximately $102.2 million. The Ventures will require additional capital from
us and Behringer Harvard Master Partnership I in order to fund the remaining
