<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; On February&nbsp;11, 2008 the
Board of Directors also authorized the payment of cash dividends (each a &#147;Daily
Distribution&#148;) to stockholders of record as of the close of business on each
day of the period commencing on March&nbsp;1, 2008 </font></p>

