supplemental returns to the investors in this program so that none lost
money.&#160; See Prior Performance Tables IV
(Results of Completed Programs) and V (Results of Sales or Disposals of
Property) in Exhibit&nbsp;A for further information regarding BRP (Renner
Plaza), LP.&#160; Additionally, certain
Behringer Harvard-sponsored tenant-in-common programs (including Behringer
Harvard Colorado Building S, LLC; Behringer Harvard Travis Tower S LP;
