<p align="left" style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;text-align:left;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">(2)&nbsp;The December&nbsp;2007
through May&nbsp;2008 distribution declarations have annualized rates based on
a purchase price of $9.25 per share. In accordance with the terms of our
private offering, the price per share increased from $9.00 to $9.25 because we
exceeded $100 million in aggregate offering proceeds. Therefore, the effective
annualized rate based on a purchase price of $9.00 per share was 4.11%<b>  </b>for the months of December&nbsp;2007 through February&nbsp;2008.</font></p>



