broker-dealers in their individual capacities, to IRAs and qualified plans of
their registered representatives or to any one of their registered representatives
in their individual capacities net of selling commissions resulting in a
purchase price of $9.30 per share, or 93.0% of the public offering price,
reflecting the fact that selling commissions in the amount of $0.70 per share
will not be payable in connection with such sales.&#160; The net proceeds to us from such sales will
be identical to net proceeds we receive from other sales of shares.</font></p>

