<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt 30.25pt;text-autospace:none;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">On April&nbsp;12, 2007,
Behringer Harvard REIT I,&nbsp;Inc. (the &#147;Company&#148;) provided loans secured by
the properties of an apartment complex containing approximately 150 rental
units (unaudited) located in Dallas, Texas (&#147;Plaza on Lovers Lane Apartments&#148;).
Amounts included in property management fees include routine compensation paid
to an equity investor for managing property operations.</font></p>

