effect of the investment in Alexan Prospect subsequent to December&nbsp;31,
2007 as if we made this investment on December&nbsp;31, 2007.&#160; The unaudited pro forma consolidated
statement of operations for year ended December&nbsp;31, 2007 reflects the
effects of our Investments as if all nine had been acquired on August&nbsp;4,
2006. </font></p>



