<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt;text-autospace:none;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p style="font-size:10.0pt;margin:0in 0in .0001pt 1.0in;text-autospace:none;text-indent:-.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">a.</font><font size="1" style="font-size:3.0pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; </font>Reflects
the historical consolidated statement of operations of Behringer Harvard
Multifamily REIT I,&nbsp;Inc. for the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2007.</p>

<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt 1.0in;text-autospace:none;text-indent:-.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p style="font-size:10.0pt;margin:0in 0in .0001pt 1.0in;text-autospace:none;text-indent:-.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">b.</font><font size="1" style="font-size:3.0pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; </font>Reflects the asset management fees associated
with our Investments.&#160; The assets are
managed by Behringer Harvard Multifamily Advisors I LP for an annual asset
management fee of 1.0% of the asset value.</p>

<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt 1.0in;text-autospace:none;text-indent:-.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p style="font-size:10.0pt;margin:0in 0in .0001pt 1.0in;text-autospace:none;text-indent:-.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">c.</font><font size="1" style="font-size:3.0pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; </font>Reflects a reduction in interest expense of
approximately $289,000 on borrowings for acquisitions of our Investments under
the Credit Facility, and a reduction in interest expense of approximately
$205,000 for amortization of Credit Facility fees.&#160; During the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2007,
we paid interest and fees totaling $925,000 for amounts we borrowed under the Credit Facility from Behringer
Harvard Operating Partnership I LP. We repaid the principal and interest on
each acquisition borrowing within four months of each acquisition. For the
purposes of these Pro Forma financial statements, all acquisitions are assumed
to have occurred on August&nbsp;4, 2006 (date of inception); as a result, we
incurred no interest expense on borrowings in the Pro Forma consolidated
statement of operations for the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2007. Included in
interest expense in the Pro Forma consolidated statement of operations for the
year ended December&nbsp;31, 2007 is the remaining amortization of costs
incurred for the Credit Facility; these costs of $328,000 have been amortized
over the Credit Facility&#146;s twelve month term. For the purposes of these Pro
Forma financials statements, this term was assumed to have begun in August&nbsp;2006.</p>

<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt 1.0in;text-autospace:none;text-indent:-.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman">&nbsp;</font></p>

<p style="margin:0in 0in .0001pt 1.0in;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;text-indent:-.5in;"><font size="2" face="Times New Roman" style="font-size:10.0pt;">d.</font><font size="1" style="font-size:3.0pt;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; </font><font size="2" style="font-size:10.0pt;">For the purposes of these Pro Forma
financial statements, all acquisitions are assumed to have occurred on August&nbsp;4,
2006 (date of inception). During 2007 we incurred acquisition and other costs
of $543,000 in connection with our Venture&#146;s equity investment in The Reserve
at Johns Creek Walk, an operating property. In addition, we incurred
acquisition and other costs of $65,000 in connection with our Venture&#146;s
underlying loan to the Alexan St. Rose property. This adjustment reflects the
monthly amortization of the costs for the Reserve at Johns Creek Walk costs
over the property&#146;s estimated useful life of 25 years, and, the costs for the
Venture&#146;s underlying loan to the Alexan St. Rose property over the loan term of
5.5 years, for the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2007. Actual acquisition costs
included acquisition and advisory fees of $495,000 paid under our agreement
with Behringer Harvard Multifamily Advisors I LP.</font></p>

