therein and the offering of such securities at that time shall be deemed to be
the initial bona fide offering thereof, (ii)&nbsp;that all post-effective
amendments will comply with the applicable forms, rules&nbsp;and regulations of
the Commission in effect at the time such post-effective amendments are filed,
and (iii)&nbsp;to remove from registration by means of a post-effective
amendment any of the securities being registered which remain unsold at the
termination of the offering.</font></p>

